<title>USA: Butler to buy interest in Beker.</title>
<headline>Butler to buy interest in Beker.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler Manufacturing Co said Friday it signed a letter of intent to acquire a 90 percent interest in Hungarian building systems fabricator Beker Kft.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. Butler said Beker's 1996 sales will reach about $3 million. The transaction is expected to close in December.</p>
<p>Butler said Beker's building systems will still be marketed from the company's Nyiregyhaza facility, and capabilities to produce Butler building systems will be added.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
